<title>BELGIUM: EU keeps molasses import duties at zero.</title>
<headline>EU keeps molasses import duties at zero.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will keep molasses import duties at zero until June 5, the EU Official Journal said.</p>
<p>The cif reference price for cane molasses was set at 8.20 Ecus per 100 kg, compared with 8.26 the previous week.</p>
<p>The cif price for beet molasses was set at 12.16 Ecus per 100 kg, against 12.13 Ecus last week.</p>
</text>
